{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"PSReaderUI"}],"role":"article","title":"Replica and Feed Editions"},"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Replica-and-Feed-Editions"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PSReaderUI SDK supports two distinct backend systems for delivering digital"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication content. Which system your publications use determines the content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types you configure, the analytics events you receive, and which delegate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods the SDK calls."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Consult the PageSuite portal or your account manager to determine which system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applies to your publications.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Shortcodes","type":"heading","text":"Shortcodes"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"shortcode"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" is a remote configuration set up in the PageSuite portal that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maps to your publication setup. When you use a shortcode with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK fetches this configuration and automatically populates the correct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publications — routing to either the feed or replica system as appropriate."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"recommended approach","type":"text"}]},{"text":" for loading content. You don’t need to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"manage GUIDs yourself or know which backend system your publications use — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shortcode handles it. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Carousel-Setup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for more detail on configuring"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sections."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Feed Editions","anchor":"Feed-Editions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Feed editions are the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"modern","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" content system. They deliver a mix of HTML"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"article templates and PDF pages, enabling responsive layouts that adapt to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different screen sizes and orientations. Key advantages over replica editions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"include:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich templates"}]},{"text":" — elaborate article layouts such as multi-column templates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that go beyond a static PDF reproduction.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"In-flow advertising","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — greater support for ads placed directly within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"article content."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Faster backend","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — improved content delivery for quicker load times.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Feed edition publications are identified by an ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"application GUID","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". When"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configuring sections manually (without a shortcode), use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".feedArchive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .feedArchive(guid: \"APP_GUID\")))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Replica-Editions","level":2,"text":"Replica Editions"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Replica editions are the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"legacy"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" content system. They deliver PDF-only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pages that reproduce the print layout of a publication. Users navigate through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a faithful digital replica of the printed product.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Replica publications are identified by a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"publication GUID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". When configuring","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sections manually (without a shortcode), use the ","type":"text"},{"code":".replicaArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" content type:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .replicaArchive(guid: \"PUB_GUID\")))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Transition","level":2,"text":"Transition"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PageSuite is transitioning publications from the replica system to feed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions. New publications are typically set up as feed editions, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"existing replica publications may be migrated over time. Your account manager"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can advise on the timeline and steps for any migration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Impact-on-the-SDK","level":2,"text":"Impact on the SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The backend system affects several areas of the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content types"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Use ","type":"text"},{"code":".feedArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for feed editions and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":".replicaArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for replica editions when configuring sections manually.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":".dynamicArchive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with a shortcode to let the SDK choose automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Analytics events","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Feed editions emit ","type":"text"},{"code":"feedEdition*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events; replica","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editions emit ","type":"text"},{"code":"replica*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Analytics","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywall delegate methods"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Separate delegate methods exist for opening"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and downloading feed vs replica editions. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Paywall-Integration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Share delegate methods"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Separate methods handle sharing for feed pages","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and replica spreads. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Audio delegate methods","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Separate methods handle TTS for feed pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and replica spreads. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Text-to-Speech","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Replica Reader Variants","anchor":"Replica-Reader-Variants","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica editions can be displayed using one of two reader implementations:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Legacy reader"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the original PDF reader with its own navigation and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toolbar UI. Configured via ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modern reader"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — a newer implementation whose look and feel matches the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feed edition reader, providing a consistent experience across both systems."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The active reader is controlled by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default is currently "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (legacy), but will change to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (modern)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a future release. If you are starting a new integration, consider using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modern reader from the outset."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/replica-and-feed-editions"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/replica-and-feed-editions"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Understand the two backend systems that power PSReaderUI content.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A UI framework for building digital newspaper and magazine reader experiences on iOS.","type":"text"}],"title":"PSReaderUI","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Sharing":{"role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/sharing","title":"Sharing","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text"